1
00:00:56,312 --> 00:01:02,614
(The Shadow Sovereign)

2
00:01:07,863 --> 00:01:09,303
Here's today's topic for discussion.

3
00:01:09,431 --> 00:01:12,128
A scholar from a humble background broke free from the shackles of lineage,

4
00:01:12,152 --> 00:01:13,728
passed the imperial exam, and entered official service.

5
00:01:13,752 --> 00:01:17,000
Is it better to serve the people and help the world,

6
00:01:17,183 --> 00:01:20,397
or should he focus on bringing glory to his family?

7
00:01:20,632 --> 00:01:22,685
Everyone, feel free to share your thoughts.

8
00:01:28,112 --> 00:01:29,672
The premise of this question is flawed.

9
00:01:34,174 --> 00:01:35,248
Serving the country and fulfilling one's own aspirations

10
00:01:35,272 --> 00:01:36,565
aren't mutually exclusive.

11
00:01:37,839 --> 00:01:38,916
What we should strive for

12
00:01:39,032 --> 00:01:40,806
is to shatter the chains of social rank,

13
00:01:41,552 --> 00:01:43,069
so that every scholar

14
00:01:43,150 --> 00:01:44,463
has a fair shot

15
00:01:44,544 --> 00:01:46,141
at making something of themselves.

16
00:01:46,242 --> 00:01:47,267
Shen Xiao.

17
00:01:47,348 --> 00:01:49,842
No, I should call you Censor Shen now.

18
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,945
You dared impeach before His Majesty

19
00:02:03,969 --> 00:02:05,329
and even stopped the imperial carriage in public.

20
00:02:05,353 --> 00:02:08,286
The fact that you only received one stroke of a whip is mercy enough.

21
00:02:08,712 --> 00:02:10,386
Why are you defending an outsider?

22
00:02:12,456 --> 00:02:13,816
You've traveled far and seen much.

23
00:02:13,951 --> 00:02:16,466
Do you know much about Princess Zhao Yang?

24
00:02:22,623 --> 00:02:23,878
I know a little.

25
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:25,734
So, what kind of person is she?

26
00:02:28,951 --> 00:02:31,096
I heard that before she was granted the title of Princess Zhao Yang,

27
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,695
she was a forgotten princess,

28
00:02:33,094 --> 00:02:34,909
left to languish in the Cold Palace.

29
00:02:35,319 --> 00:02:36,894
She lived a very difficult life.

30
00:02:37,217 --> 00:02:38,431
(The Cold Palace?)

31
00:02:42,726 --> 00:02:45,549
(Was that scar also from her days in the Cold Palace?)

32
00:02:47,304 --> 00:02:49,397
How long was she stuck in that place?

33
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,494
And how did she ever get out?

34
00:02:51,999 --> 00:02:53,159
As for her and Cui Jin Zhi...

35
00:02:53,207 --> 00:02:55,079
Are they really in love, or

36
00:02:55,312 --> 00:02:56,632
is there another story behind it?

37
00:02:58,087 --> 00:03:01,462
Since when have you become so interested in the Princess?

38
00:03:04,111 --> 00:03:05,885
She's the Crown Prince's confidante,

39
00:03:06,231 --> 00:03:08,391
yet she's been secretly dealing with me all this time,

40
00:03:08,712 --> 00:03:10,206
keeping me in the capital.

41
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:13,649
On the surface, she appears extravagant and indulgent.

42
00:03:14,312 --> 00:03:15,766
But I can't shake the feeling

43
00:03:17,671 --> 00:03:19,605
that's not the whole story.

44
00:03:19,951 --> 00:03:21,686
Is she a friend or an enemy?

45
00:03:22,152 --> 00:03:23,308
I really can't tell.

46
00:03:23,391 --> 00:03:24,605
Why not grant him

47
00:03:24,752 --> 00:03:27,680
an eighth-rank Supervising Censor position to remain in the capital?

48
00:03:27,878 --> 00:03:29,092
Could it be

49
00:03:30,384 --> 00:03:32,381
that you just can't get me out of your mind?

50
00:03:32,552 --> 00:03:33,806
If the need arises,

51
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:36,157
you may ask for my help.

52
00:03:36,238 --> 00:03:38,712
I only had you whipped a few times. That was already an act of mercy.

53
00:03:38,736 --> 00:03:40,149
If you keep blocking the way,

54
00:03:40,312 --> 00:03:42,028
don't blame me for getting rough.

55
00:03:42,111 --> 00:03:43,268
You want to use me.

56
00:03:43,351 --> 00:03:44,965
I can make it happen.

57
00:03:45,448 --> 00:03:47,222
The less clearly I can see her,

58
00:03:47,624 --> 00:03:49,158
the more I want to figure her out.

59
00:03:49,751 --> 00:03:51,005
Do you wish she were

60
00:03:51,367 --> 00:03:52,524
an enemy

61
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:53,933
or a friend?

62
00:03:54,670 --> 00:03:56,630
To know a person, one must look into their heart.

63
00:03:56,712 --> 00:03:57,926
You'll have to

64
00:03:59,152 --> 00:04:00,565
find that answer yourself.

65
00:04:10,032 --> 00:04:12,488
Your Highness, we have come under imperial orders to transport the grain.

66
00:04:12,512 --> 00:04:14,192
Please don't make things difficult for us.

67
00:04:15,136 --> 00:04:16,812
His Majesty has decreed that

68
00:04:16,911 --> 00:04:20,869
grain from every granary in the capital be transferred to Yongtong Canal.

69
00:04:20,952 --> 00:04:22,028
Move! Hurry!

70
00:04:22,111 --> 00:04:25,111
Your Highness, the grain has been transferred into the private storehouses.

71
00:04:33,392 --> 00:04:34,778
- Your Highness. - Move aside.

72
00:04:34,888 --> 00:04:36,141
This is the Princess Residence.

73
00:04:36,472 --> 00:04:38,048
I advise Your Highness not to force your way in.

74
00:04:38,072 --> 00:04:39,366
You insolent servant!

75
00:04:41,911 --> 00:04:43,400
- Let go! - Jian Xin.

76
00:04:43,543 --> 00:04:45,229
Let the Second Prince in.

77
00:04:49,207 --> 00:04:50,421
Your Highness.

78
00:04:51,032 --> 00:04:52,246
This way, please.

79
00:04:53,776 --> 00:04:54,990
Insolent servant.

80
00:04:56,239 --> 00:04:58,406
Li Shu!

81
00:04:59,032 --> 00:05:00,846
Second Brother, you're fired up today.

82
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:09,951
Using grain instead of money has put my Ministry of Revenue in a real bind.

83
00:05:09,975 --> 00:05:12,256
Don't tell me this wasn't your idea for the Crown Prince.

84
00:05:12,855 --> 00:05:14,573
Second Brother, you don't have any proof.

85
00:05:14,712 --> 00:05:16,506
Why are you so sure it was me?

86
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:20,000
Everyone knows you're the Crown Prince's strategist.

87
00:05:20,152 --> 00:05:21,570
The grain reserves under the Ministry of Revenue

88
00:05:21,594 --> 00:05:23,350
are about to be emptied by the Ministry of Works and the Ministry of War.

89
00:05:23,374 --> 00:05:25,632
You're driving me into a dead end.

90
00:05:28,216 --> 00:05:30,373
There's no such thing as a dead end in this world.

91
00:05:30,663 --> 00:05:33,007
You already have someone ready to be put to use, Second Brother.

92
00:05:33,031 --> 00:05:34,685
Why make things harder for yourself?

93
00:05:37,911 --> 00:05:39,125
Do you mean

94
00:05:39,568 --> 00:05:40,782
Shen Xiao?

95
00:05:42,111 --> 00:05:43,120
Ridiculous.

96
00:05:43,655 --> 00:05:45,109
He's way too bold.

97
00:05:45,231 --> 00:05:46,508
Though he's upright and loyal,

98
00:05:46,631 --> 00:05:48,000
he's bound to stir up trouble.

99
00:05:48,093 --> 00:05:49,347
What's there to be afraid of?

100
00:05:49,718 --> 00:05:51,878
He was personally chosen by Father as the Top Scholar.

101
00:05:51,928 --> 00:05:53,840
If you take him under your wing

102
00:05:53,992 --> 00:05:56,389
and have him oversee the grain-in-lieu-of-payment policy,

103
00:05:56,512 --> 00:05:58,406
you'll be riding on Father's favor.

104
00:05:59,016 --> 00:06:00,212
If it works out,

105
00:06:00,327 --> 00:06:02,301
your Ministry of Revenue gets the credit.

106
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,134
If it fails,

107
00:06:04,312 --> 00:06:05,880
Father will just blame

108
00:06:05,992 --> 00:06:07,520
the noble clans.

109
00:06:07,737 --> 00:06:09,537
Either way, the blame will never fall on you.

110
00:06:23,064 --> 00:06:24,678
Why would you be so kind

111
00:06:25,318 --> 00:06:26,573
to offer me advice?

112
00:06:29,711 --> 00:06:31,285
Believe it or not,

113
00:06:31,896 --> 00:06:33,470
that's entirely up to you.

114
00:07:11,823 --> 00:07:13,358
(From now on, use this)

115
00:07:14,311 --> 00:07:16,151
(to get in and out of the Princess Residence.)

116
00:07:23,719 --> 00:07:25,493
Don't forget our meeting tonight.

117
00:07:28,032 --> 00:07:29,366
What am I even doing?

118
00:07:32,688 --> 00:07:34,462
Why did I agree with her?

119
00:07:35,855 --> 00:07:37,110
Am I losing my mind?

120
00:07:40,072 --> 00:07:43,286
How did she survive all those years in the Cold Palace?

121
00:07:57,214 --> 00:07:58,948
Since I accepted this flower hairpin,

122
00:08:00,271 --> 00:08:01,565
I should keep my promise.

123
00:08:03,319 --> 00:08:05,494
If I give someone my word, I must honor it.

124
00:08:08,151 --> 00:08:09,640
That's what Father taught me.

125
00:08:13,950 --> 00:08:15,560
(Humble Abode)

126
00:08:21,432 --> 00:08:24,272
Censor Shen, the Princess has been waiting for you for quite some time.

127
00:08:39,441 --> 00:08:41,704
(Xianke Bordello)

128
00:08:42,974 --> 00:08:46,120
Your Highness, why are you pushing Shen the thief toward the Second Prince?

129
00:08:46,927 --> 00:08:49,120
If I'm to use one blade to take down the Crown Prince,

130
00:08:49,302 --> 00:08:50,871
I must first borrow another's strength.

131
00:08:51,007 --> 00:08:52,341
Shen Xiao will be the blade.

132
00:08:52,592 --> 00:08:54,432
The Second Prince will be the force behind it.

133
00:08:56,151 --> 00:08:57,365
Wait.

134
00:08:58,079 --> 00:08:59,559
What do you mean by "Shen the thief"?

135
00:09:00,039 --> 00:09:01,239
A thief is someone who steals.

136
00:09:01,376 --> 00:09:03,844
Shen Xiao has stolen Your Highness's heart.

137
00:09:04,007 --> 00:09:05,221
So, isn't he a thief?

138
00:09:06,567 --> 00:09:07,822
Nonsense.

139
00:09:09,728 --> 00:09:12,700
Isn't Your Highness's blade supposed to arrive tonight?

140
00:09:13,255 --> 00:09:15,269
Why hasn't he shown up yet?

141
00:09:16,808 --> 00:09:19,120
Your Highness has been waiting forever.

142
00:09:21,158 --> 00:09:23,013
He has a subtle fragrance on him.

143
00:09:23,296 --> 00:09:24,790
Can you recreate it?

144
00:09:25,552 --> 00:09:27,530
You've met him, so you should've noticed it.

145
00:09:28,495 --> 00:09:29,838
I'm afraid I can't help with that.

146
00:09:29,862 --> 00:09:32,493
I never smelled any fragrance on Shen Xiao.

147
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,556
But I've heard that

148
00:09:34,645 --> 00:09:35,883
there's a kind of fragrance

149
00:09:36,020 --> 00:09:38,301
that can only be perceived by two people who are in love.

150
00:09:39,777 --> 00:09:41,982
Oh no. Now he's really Shen the thief.

151
00:09:42,142 --> 00:09:44,120
A thief who steals hearts.

152
00:09:45,679 --> 00:09:47,095
I think you're losing it.

153
00:09:47,352 --> 00:09:49,072
How could I possibly have feelings for him?

154
00:09:49,471 --> 00:09:51,240
If you can't help, just get out.

155
00:09:51,449 --> 00:09:53,009
Who says I can't help?

156
00:09:53,632 --> 00:09:55,302
Do you want me to tie Shen Xiao up and bring him to you?

157
00:09:55,326 --> 00:09:56,568
Your Highness, would that work for you?

158
00:09:56,592 --> 00:09:57,720
You...

159
00:10:08,135 --> 00:10:10,110
(Could that scent on him)

160
00:10:10,432 --> 00:10:12,926
(really have been nothing more than my imagination?)

161
00:10:48,256 --> 00:10:49,470
Who are you?

162
00:10:58,151 --> 00:10:59,560
So it's you, Princess An Le.

163
00:11:00,087 --> 00:11:01,400
Forgive my discourtesy.

164
00:11:02,152 --> 00:11:03,560
Discourtesy?

165
00:11:04,103 --> 00:11:05,880
I'd be disappointed if you

166
00:11:06,318 --> 00:11:07,773
weren't a little discourteous.

167
00:11:10,712 --> 00:11:12,640
If Your Highness has official business,

168
00:11:12,904 --> 00:11:14,517
you may send word to the Censorate.

169
00:11:14,672 --> 00:11:15,965
If there's nothing else,

170
00:11:16,393 --> 00:11:17,806
I'll take my leave.

171
00:11:20,303 --> 00:11:22,020
You're merely an eighth-rank official.

172
00:11:22,151 --> 00:11:24,016
What official business could you possibly have?

173
00:11:24,040 --> 00:11:25,396
I invited you here.

174
00:11:25,495 --> 00:11:28,050
You know perfectly well why.

175
00:11:28,342 --> 00:11:29,797
If you keep playing dumb,

176
00:11:30,151 --> 00:11:31,800
it's going to get boring.

177
00:11:33,383 --> 00:11:35,280
I've always been a rather boring man.

178
00:11:35,631 --> 00:11:37,640
Your Highness, please let me leave.

179
00:11:38,623 --> 00:11:40,780
I've been widowed for over three years.

180
00:11:40,879 --> 00:11:42,172
I've met countless people.

181
00:11:42,552 --> 00:11:44,880
You are the most interesting of them all.

182
00:11:45,304 --> 00:11:46,518
To be honest,

183
00:11:48,295 --> 00:11:49,623
at the banquet celebrating the Top Scholar,

184
00:11:49,647 --> 00:11:52,367
I saw you wearing this crimson robe embroidered with golden blossoms

185
00:11:52,462 --> 00:11:54,062
and your bold move to impeach Zhao Yang.

186
00:11:54,229 --> 00:11:56,149
Honestly, I still can't get that out of my head.

187
00:11:56,351 --> 00:11:58,406
If you wear that robe again, Censor Shen,

188
00:11:59,062 --> 00:12:00,219
I'll let you leave.

189
00:12:00,351 --> 00:12:01,565
What do you say?

190
00:12:04,590 --> 00:12:06,232
Your Highness should conduct yourself with propriety.

191
00:12:06,256 --> 00:12:07,440
I'll be taking my leave now.

192
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:14,053
I heard today that

193
00:12:14,839 --> 00:12:17,560
you were whipped by Zhao Yang in front of everyone.

194
00:12:18,175 --> 00:12:20,630
I have a healing ointment bestowed by His Majesty.

195
00:12:21,095 --> 00:12:23,509
How about I apply it for you myself?

196
00:12:26,087 --> 00:12:28,501
Such an imperial gift is not something I am worthy of.

197
00:12:29,968 --> 00:12:31,182
I'll take my leave.

198
00:12:32,351 --> 00:12:33,565
Get out of my way!

199
00:12:36,272 --> 00:12:37,429
Bring him back here!

200
00:12:37,511 --> 00:12:38,725
Yes!

201
00:12:38,952 --> 00:12:40,229
My guards are at the door!

202
00:12:40,312 --> 00:12:42,286
You're not getting out today!

203
00:12:45,319 --> 00:12:47,327
When did such a handsome young gentleman join this place?

204
00:12:47,351 --> 00:12:48,389
Are you new here?

205
00:12:48,472 --> 00:12:49,788
- What's your name? - Stop!

206
00:12:49,918 --> 00:12:52,040
Hurry! He ran that way! Go after him!

207
00:12:52,359 --> 00:12:54,879
The Princess has given her orders. We must capture him tonight.

208
00:12:55,287 --> 00:12:57,722
(Fengqi Pavilion)

209
00:13:12,472 --> 00:13:13,973
Why does nothing feel right?

210
00:13:27,376 --> 00:13:28,991
Censor Shen, you're late.

211
00:13:29,384 --> 00:13:30,598
It seems that

212
00:13:31,230 --> 00:13:32,880
I've spoiled Your Highness's good mood.

213
00:13:33,462 --> 00:13:35,280
Then why aren't you leaving already?

214
00:13:37,384 --> 00:13:38,638
I'm not leaving.

215
00:13:41,455 --> 00:13:42,669
Let them go.

216
00:13:47,319 --> 00:13:49,275
Shen Xiao definitely ran this way!

217
00:13:49,382 --> 00:13:50,680
Search every room!

218
00:14:00,615 --> 00:14:02,057
As expected of you, Censor Shen.

219
00:14:02,448 --> 00:14:03,805
You're here for my invitation,

220
00:14:03,886 --> 00:14:05,339
yet you manage to provoke An Le.

221
00:14:05,744 --> 00:14:07,701
If you become her male companion,

222
00:14:07,846 --> 00:14:09,780
you might even earn yourself a promotion.

223
00:14:09,911 --> 00:14:11,911
Censor Shen, you really know how to play the game.

224
00:14:12,767 --> 00:14:15,327
I've already promised to keep Your Highness company every night.

225
00:14:15,616 --> 00:14:17,750
I never planned to get involved with anyone else.

226
00:14:19,511 --> 00:14:21,308
Censor Shen, is this loyalty?

227
00:14:21,454 --> 00:14:23,308
Or are you just trying to sweet-talk me,

228
00:14:23,471 --> 00:14:25,244
so I'll end up offending An Le for you?

229
00:14:28,776 --> 00:14:29,880
Does it still hurt?

230
00:14:29,993 --> 00:14:31,038
It hurts.

231
00:14:34,102 --> 00:14:36,280
Then that whipping you took was hardly in vain.

232
00:14:36,353 --> 00:14:38,360
You publicly confronted the arrogant princess,

233
00:14:38,512 --> 00:14:40,640
won yourself the reputation of defending the common people,

234
00:14:40,664 --> 00:14:42,758
and then came here to put on this pitiful act.

235
00:14:43,111 --> 00:14:44,800
When you say you want to make use of me,

236
00:14:45,127 --> 00:14:46,902
you certainly are making good use of me.

237
00:14:48,024 --> 00:14:49,760
What exactly did Your Highness go through

238
00:14:50,038 --> 00:14:52,280
to think so poorly of people's hearts?

239
00:14:56,496 --> 00:14:58,640
Instead of digging into my past, Censor Shen,

240
00:14:59,512 --> 00:15:01,325
you should care more about the people.

241
00:15:03,135 --> 00:15:04,840
I just happened to meet some bad people,

242
00:15:06,111 --> 00:15:07,871
but they've been stuck in a messed-up world.

243
00:15:13,528 --> 00:15:14,742
Take off your clothes.

244
00:15:24,799 --> 00:15:26,119
You've already treated the wound.

245
00:15:26,164 --> 00:15:27,724
But it wasn't Your Highness who did it.

246
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:31,814
So...

247
00:15:32,072 --> 00:15:34,205
You wanted the princess to apply it for you?

248
00:15:38,231 --> 00:15:39,920
Your princess is outside.

249
00:15:44,151 --> 00:15:46,386
(If I'm seen getting too close to you in front of An Le, )

250
00:15:46,410 --> 00:15:48,290
(the Crown Prince definitely won't let me off.)

251
00:15:48,551 --> 00:15:49,893
(I can't save you today.)

252
00:15:52,079 --> 00:15:53,600
(I'm obviously not worthy)

253
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:56,319
(of asking you to risk yourself before the Crown Prince's sister.)

254
00:15:56,343 --> 00:15:57,581
Shen Xiao!

255
00:15:57,808 --> 00:15:59,742
I didn't expect you'd hide in Fengqi Pavilion!

256
00:16:01,792 --> 00:16:03,028
Zhao Yang, get out here!

257
00:16:03,151 --> 00:16:04,565
Why is he at your place?

258
00:16:13,039 --> 00:16:15,117
He barged in himself while panicking.

259
00:16:15,472 --> 00:16:17,600
My little sister, a forced melon is never sweet.

260
00:16:17,743 --> 00:16:18,890
Why put yourself through this?

261
00:16:18,914 --> 00:16:20,274
I don't care if it's sweet or not.

262
00:16:20,312 --> 00:16:22,632
If it's not sweet, I'll dip it in sauce and eat it anyway.

263
00:16:23,183 --> 00:16:25,295
Your Highness, are you really set on making a court official

264
00:16:25,319 --> 00:16:26,920
your personal entertainer?

265
00:16:28,351 --> 00:16:30,161
So what? Censor Shen,

266
00:16:30,242 --> 00:16:32,328
are you planning to defy my command even if it costs you your life?

267
00:16:32,352 --> 00:16:35,040
Your Highness's games are not worth dying for.

268
00:16:35,263 --> 00:16:37,440
But if Your Highness keeps pushing me,

269
00:16:37,727 --> 00:16:39,560
I can't promise I won't hurt you.

270
00:16:40,551 --> 00:16:41,680
You...

271
00:16:45,712 --> 00:16:46,926
You dare?

272
00:16:51,632 --> 00:16:54,251
Looks like An Le won't leave empty-handed today.

273
00:16:54,463 --> 00:16:57,560
Censor Shen, you're clearly a man who knows when to yield.

274
00:16:58,071 --> 00:16:59,349
Why not just go along with it?

275
00:16:59,432 --> 00:17:02,081
Your official career would surely be smooth sailing from then on.

276
00:17:02,215 --> 00:17:03,789
Your future would be limitless.

277
00:17:07,041 --> 00:17:08,455
(Reinforcements have arrived.)

278
00:17:12,374 --> 00:17:14,720
An Le, you've become far too bold!

279
00:17:18,312 --> 00:17:20,086
His Majesty has always turned a blind eye

280
00:17:20,656 --> 00:17:22,720
to your antics before.

281
00:17:23,120 --> 00:17:25,253
But now, you dare try to kill the Top Scholar who was

282
00:17:26,704 --> 00:17:28,144
personally appointed by His Majesty.

283
00:17:28,376 --> 00:17:29,533
It wasn't me.

284
00:17:29,616 --> 00:17:30,721
It was Zhao Yang!

285
00:17:30,823 --> 00:17:33,469
- It was her! - What happened today ends here.

286
00:17:33,584 --> 00:17:35,237
If I catch you

287
00:17:35,432 --> 00:17:36,880
bothering Censor Shen again,

288
00:17:37,149 --> 00:17:38,720
don't blame me for telling Father

289
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:40,314
and having your lands taken away.

290
00:17:43,990 --> 00:17:45,268
What are you laughing at?

291
00:17:45,432 --> 00:17:46,646
I'm laughing,

292
00:17:46,864 --> 00:17:48,424
thinking about how much you should pay up.

293
00:17:48,448 --> 00:17:49,781
None of your business.

294
00:17:50,494 --> 00:17:53,160
Do you know how many customers you scared away tonight?

295
00:17:54,632 --> 00:17:56,320
So, you really didn't know.

296
00:17:56,696 --> 00:17:59,280
Xianke Bordello belongs to the Crown Prince.

297
00:18:00,614 --> 00:18:02,760
Stop trying to scare me with the Crown Prince.

298
00:18:04,432 --> 00:18:05,646
Let's go.

299
00:18:07,152 --> 00:18:08,726
Don't forget the compensation.

300
00:18:15,304 --> 00:18:16,420
Censor Shen,

301
00:18:16,590 --> 00:18:18,240
An Le won't bother you anymore.

302
00:18:18,624 --> 00:18:21,061
Thank you, Your Highness, for saving my life.

303
00:18:21,182 --> 00:18:22,676
Censor Shen, you flatter me.

304
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:24,880
- It was only a small favor. - By the way,

305
00:18:25,287 --> 00:18:27,160
why brought Your Highness to Xianke Bordello?

306
00:18:27,382 --> 00:18:30,120
I came here specifically to find you, Censor Shen.

307
00:18:30,632 --> 00:18:32,960
My people saw An Le bringing you here.

308
00:18:33,871 --> 00:18:35,326
The disaster is getting worse by the day.

309
00:18:35,350 --> 00:18:37,230
We're short-staffed at the Ministry of Revenue.

310
00:18:37,511 --> 00:18:38,725
I wonder if

311
00:18:39,134 --> 00:18:41,534
you would be willing to serve under the Ministry of Revenue?

312
00:18:42,320 --> 00:18:44,094
First, you impeached Zhao Yang.

313
00:18:44,207 --> 00:18:46,154
Then, you urged the restoration of the Yongtong Canal.

314
00:18:46,178 --> 00:18:47,800
And now, you've offended An Le as well.

315
00:18:47,881 --> 00:18:49,840
The Crown Prince won't let you off.

316
00:18:50,431 --> 00:18:52,880
Why not work for me?

317
00:18:53,688 --> 00:18:55,680
If Your Highness doesn't mind my reckless ways,

318
00:18:55,744 --> 00:18:57,903
I am willing to serve and share Your Highness's burdens.

319
00:18:57,927 --> 00:19:00,280
Consider it repayment for today's kindness.

320
00:19:00,896 --> 00:19:03,400
But I'm afraid the Crown Prince won't let you go that easily.

321
00:19:03,488 --> 00:19:05,328
If the Censorate doesn't approve the transfer,

322
00:19:05,463 --> 00:19:07,838
I can't force it either.

323
00:19:08,991 --> 00:19:11,846
I understand what Your Highness means.

324
00:19:12,336 --> 00:19:14,480
I'll find a way to secure the transfer order.

325
00:19:29,592 --> 00:19:31,885
(The first from a humble family to break free of fate.)

326
00:19:32,864 --> 00:19:35,240
(Making the honor roll shakes the realm.)

327
00:19:37,071 --> 00:19:39,926
(Never say noble gates are impossible to cross.)

328
00:19:41,175 --> 00:19:43,790
(Even a scholar in plain robes can soar to the highest rank.)

329
00:19:44,201 --> 00:19:46,520
(Shen Qing Zhi's grave)

330
00:19:47,952 --> 00:19:49,029
(The results are out!)

331
00:19:49,112 --> 00:19:50,406
(The results are out, Father!)

332
00:19:50,903 --> 00:19:52,480
I'll check the list for you!

333
00:20:12,681 --> 00:20:14,960
(Shen Qing Zhi)

334
00:20:15,807 --> 00:20:17,520
You made it!

335
00:20:20,152 --> 00:20:22,228
Last place in the second class!

336
00:20:22,311 --> 00:20:23,389
I made it?

337
00:20:23,472 --> 00:20:24,586
Did I really make it?

338
00:20:25,311 --> 00:20:27,406
Great! That's amazing!

339
00:20:27,775 --> 00:20:29,013
I made it!

340
00:20:29,152 --> 00:20:30,468
I made it!

341
00:20:30,551 --> 00:20:31,818
I made it!

342
00:20:33,367 --> 00:20:34,840
All that shouting for last place.

343
00:20:34,921 --> 00:20:37,663
Anyone who didn't know better would think he had become the Top Scholar.

344
00:20:37,687 --> 00:20:38,844
For a man of humble family,

345
00:20:38,952 --> 00:20:41,160
even making the list is enough to lose one's senses.

346
00:20:42,152 --> 00:20:44,205
Last place is still a successful candidate.

347
00:20:44,639 --> 00:20:45,715
Xiao, tell me.

348
00:20:45,831 --> 00:20:47,088
Should I serve in one of the Six Ministries

349
00:20:47,112 --> 00:20:48,792
or join one of the Three Judicial Offices?

350
00:20:52,031 --> 00:20:54,449
- The first from a humble family to break free of fate. - Great!

351
00:20:54,473 --> 00:20:57,429
- Making the honor roll shakes the realm. - Great!

352
00:20:57,512 --> 00:20:59,926
Never say noble gates are impossible to cross.

353
00:21:01,015 --> 00:21:03,412
Even a scholar in plain robes can soar to the highest rank.

354
00:21:03,551 --> 00:21:04,805
Great!

355
00:21:05,952 --> 00:21:07,088
How do you like these lines of poetry?

356
00:21:07,112 --> 00:21:08,525
When I'm gone someday,

357
00:21:08,734 --> 00:21:10,920
(Xiao can have these words carved on my tombstone.)

358
00:21:11,751 --> 00:21:13,920
(Father, you're thinking way too far ahead.)

359
00:21:28,983 --> 00:21:30,040
Father.

360
00:21:33,672 --> 00:21:34,749
It's already midnight.

361
00:21:34,830 --> 00:21:35,987
Why aren't you asleep?

362
00:21:36,068 --> 00:21:37,704
If you know it's late, then go to bed.

363
00:21:37,831 --> 00:21:39,086
Why worry about me?

364
00:21:39,352 --> 00:21:41,005
You have to study in the morning.

365
00:21:41,199 --> 00:21:42,413
Go on, hurry.

366
00:21:53,375 --> 00:21:54,480
Father.

367
00:21:56,472 --> 00:21:58,240
I'm about to join the Ministry of Revenue.

368
00:22:00,775 --> 00:22:02,975
I don't believe you really died falling off that cliff.

369
00:22:04,519 --> 00:22:05,733
The reason for your death

370
00:22:07,239 --> 00:22:08,733
(must have been connected to)

371
00:22:09,633 --> 00:22:12,120
(that letter impeaching the Crown Prince.)
